WEBVTT

00:03:58.276 --> 00:04:01.112
kabelning materiali
etarlicha mustahkam bo’lishi kerak

00:04:01.112 --> 00:04:03.698
qarshi og’irlikning tortilishiga 
bardosh berish uchun.

00:04:03.698 --> 00:04:08.703
Va bu kuchlanish va tortishish kuchi
turli nuqtalarda o’zgarganligi sababli ,

00:04:08.703 --> 00:04:12.540
uning kuchi va qalinligi ham
har xil bo’lishi kerak.

00:04:13.124 --> 00:04:18.254
Uglerod nanotubalari va olmos nano-iplari
kabi muhandislik materiallari

00:04:18.254 --> 00:04:21.257
bizning katta umidimiz materiallar 
ishlab chiqarish

00:04:21.257 --> 00:04:23.801
ish uchun etarlicha kuchli va engil.

00:04:24.218 --> 00:04:25.261
ammo hozirgacha,

00:04:25.261 --> 00:04:29.849
Biz faqat juda kichik nanotuba 
zanjirlarini ishlab chiqara oldik .

00:04:29.849 --> 00:04:34.103
Yana bir variant -
tortishish kuchi zaifroq joyda qurish .